# PROVISIONAL — CANON REVIEW REQUIRED: all dialogue prose and option text in this file.
~ start
Themka Gaath: Your trial is complete. The Council's first charge lies beyond Dom, on Dorthkor Road.
=> charge

~ charge
- "Ask what truth matters before taking the road." [#tag=UNDERTONE] [if not QuestRegistry.is_active(QuestRegistry.DORTHKOR_ROAD) and not QuestRegistry.is_done(QuestRegistry.DORTHKOR_ROAD) and not GameState.get_flag("chapter_council_charge_check_failed") and check("undertone", 40) /]
	do SkillCheck.resolve("undertone")
	if SkillCheck.last_check_succeeded()
		do GameState.set_flag("chapter_council_charge_understood", true)
		do QuestRegistry.offer(QuestRegistry.DORTHKOR_ROAD)
		Themka Gaath: Bring back what the road proves, not what Dom hopes to hear.
		=> END
	else
		do GameState.set_flag("chapter_council_charge_check_failed", true)
		Themka Gaath: Understanding can follow commitment. The road still waits.
		=> charge
- "I will carry the Council's charge to Dorthkor Road." [if not QuestRegistry.is_active(QuestRegistry.DORTHKOR_ROAD) and not QuestRegistry.is_done(QuestRegistry.DORTHKOR_ROAD) /]
	do QuestRegistry.offer(QuestRegistry.DORTHKOR_ROAD)
	Themka Gaath: Then go. Reach Dorthkor Road and confirm what waits beyond Dom.
	=> END
- "The Council's charge is already mine." [if QuestRegistry.is_active(QuestRegistry.DORTHKOR_ROAD) /]
	Themka Gaath: The world map is open. Begin the journey to Dorthkor Road.
	=> END
- "The Dorthkor charge is finished." [if QuestRegistry.is_done(QuestRegistry.DORTHKOR_ROAD) /]
	Themka Gaath: Then the road has given the Council its answer.
	=> END
## Act I's closing read-back (#246). Gaath routes to the closer's own file while
## the hook is live (QuestRegistry.dialogue_route_for_actor), so this branch only
## becomes reachable once it has resolved — and it is what reads
## `chapter_roar_certain` back to the player, so the flag the sounding check
## writes is never a number nobody ever hears again.
- "About the count I brought you." [if QuestRegistry.is_done(QuestRegistry.UNANSWERED_ROAR) and GameState.get_flag("chapter_roar_certain") /]
	Themka Gaath: You were certain of it. That is the part I keep returning to.
	Themka Gaath: A doubtful number I could have argued with. Yours I can only act on.
	=> END
- "About the count I brought you." [if QuestRegistry.is_done(QuestRegistry.UNANSWERED_ROAR) and not GameState.get_flag("chapter_roar_certain") /]
	Themka Gaath: You told me you would not sign it. I have thought about that every day since.
	Themka Gaath: Three benches signed numbers they were sure of. You are the only one who brought me a doubt, and you are the only one I believe.
	=> END
- "I need a moment."
	=> END
